{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2f888a39-2760-82ce-a281-6166437d1ba7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-22T14:53:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniel Cohen",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hi. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, I saw the recording said to try this line, so I hope this is okay to call. Is this okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you're good. This line's open for storm stuff. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's the catch basin at the corner by my house. It's totally clogged with leaves, packed solid, and the water's backing up into my driveway. It's been coming up all afternoon since the storm ended."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, the nor'easter that came in yesterday. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:40-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "116 Chapel Street, up on the Hill. Daniel Cohen. The drain's right at the corner there, and the water, it's up to the hubcaps on my car. The hubcaps. I'm worried it's going to keep rising, you know, if it's not cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:51:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, hubcap deep, clogged basin at the corner of Chapel. Got it. Is it getting into the house or the garage at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:52:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not yet, not yet. Just the driveway. But it's close, and honestly this keeps happening, every time we get a big rain that basin's full of leaves and nobody comes to clear it. Nobody. Is it going to get cleared?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:52:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'm putting it in as a clogged catch basin with standing water. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:52:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:52:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five four, perfect. I'll open the work order tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:52:35-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And what date will it be, the work order? Like what day will they come? Because I have my kid's swim meet Saturday at seven and I need to get the car out, I can't have the driveway like a pond, you know? It needs to be fixed before then, is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:52:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The work order will be dated today, Sunday. After a storm like this the crews are working through a pile of these, so I'd expect somebody out there Monday or Tuesday. Well before Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:53:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday or Tuesday. Okay. So not today, then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:53:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Probably not today, no. If the water starts heading toward the house, call back on this line and I'll flag it as urgent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:53:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, I will. I just don't want it to sit there, you know, and get worse. But Monday or Tuesday, you've got it written down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:53:29-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Written down. Chapel Street corner, leaves, driveway flooding, call back at the number you gave me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:53:35-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-22T14:53:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Stay dry."
    }
  ],
